Introduction
League of Legends Patch 26.21 is scheduled for October 21, 2026, according to Riot's patch calendar. This update is expected to be the first post-Worlds patch, shifting the focus toward Ranked balance and the end-of-season climb.

The preview includes buffs for champions such as Azir, Orianna and Ryze, nerfs for popular picks including Caitlyn, Lee Sin and Yone, and several major item adjustments.

Important: These are preview changes, not final patch notes. Riot may modify the numbers before release. 

