Other champion adjustments
- Locke: Mana costs and damage values are being adjusted to make mistakes more costly while keeping his overall power relatively neutral.
- Varus: Power is being shifted away from W-max builds and toward Q-max builds.
- Taric: Q and R should work when cast on untargetable allies.
- Twisted Fate: R should reveal untargetable units.
- Zaahen: A bug affecting Q1 and Q2 damage when he becomes invisible mid-strike is being fixed.
These changes are also part of the preview and should be verified against Riot's final patch notes before publication. 

